Error [jet.ArenaViewEscapes]: `x` cannot be shared — it does not live long enough to be returned
  --> tests/ui/context_scratch_escape.jet:7:12
    |
  7 |     return x
    |            ^
 Why: `x` is a view into `context.scratch`; sharing it outside the region would let it outlive `context.scratch` and point into freed memory
 Fix: Keep `x` inside the `context.scratch` region, or copy what you need out with `x.copy()` before it leaves
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0631
